@startuml CountDownLatch 跨线程唤醒机制时序图

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 60

participant "业务线程1\n(main)" as Thread1
participant "业务线程2\n(worker-1)" as Thread2
participant "NettyRemotingClient" as RpcClient
participant "ResponseFuture1" as Future1
participant "ResponseFuture2" as Future2
participant "FUTURE_TABLE" as Table
participant "CountDownLatch1" as Latch1
participant "CountDownLatch2" as Latch2
participant "EventLoop 线程\n(NettyClientThread-1)" as EventLoopThread
participant "NettyClientHandler" as ClientHandler

== 问题1：为什么可以跨线程唤醒？ ==

note over Thread1, Latch1
  **关键：通过共享的 CountDownLatch 对象实现跨线程通信**
end note

group 请求1：业务线程1
    Thread1 -> RpcClient: sendSync(request1, opaque=1)
    activate RpcClient
    
    RpcClient -> Future1: new ResponseFuture(opaque=1, timeout)
    activate Future1
    Future1 -> Latch1: new CountDownLatch(1)
    activate Latch1
    note right of Latch1
      **创建共享的 CountDownLatch 对象**
      这个对象可以被多个线程访问
    end note
    Latch1 --> Future1: latch 对象
    deactivate Latch1
    
    Future1 -> Table: put(1, future1)
    activate Table
    Table -> Table: 存储到全局表
    Table --> Future1: 存储成功
    deactivate Table
    
    Future1 --> RpcClient: ResponseFuture1
    deactivate Future1
    
    RpcClient -> RpcClient: channel.writeAndFlush(request1)
    RpcClient -> Future1: waitResponse()
    activate Future1
    
    Future1 -> Latch1: await(timeout)
    activate Latch1
    note right of Latch1
      **业务线程1 阻塞在这里**
      Thread1 进入 WAITING 状态
      释放 CPU，等待被唤醒
    end note
    
    Latch1 --> Future1: (阻塞等待)
    deactivate Latch1
    Future1 --> RpcClient: (阻塞)
    deactivate Future1
    RpcClient --> Thread1: (阻塞)
    deactivate RpcClient
end

group 请求2：业务线程2（并发）
    Thread2 -> RpcClient: sendSync(request2, opaque=2)
    activate RpcClient
    
    RpcClient -> Future2: new ResponseFuture(opaque=2, timeout)
    activate Future2
    Future2 -> Latch2: new CountDownLatch(1)
    activate Latch2
    Latch2 --> Future2: latch 对象
    deactivate Latch2
    
    Future2 -> Table: put(2, future2)
    activate Table
    Table -> Table: 存储到全局表
    Table --> Future2: 存储成功
    deactivate Table
    
    Future2 --> RpcClient: ResponseFuture2
    deactivate Future2
    
    RpcClient -> RpcClient: channel.writeAndFlush(request2)
    RpcClient -> Future2: waitResponse()
    activate Future2
    
    Future2 -> Latch2: await(timeout)
    activate Latch2
    note right of Latch2
      **业务线程2 阻塞在这里**
      Thread2 进入 WAITING 状态
      释放 CPU，等待被唤醒
      
      ⚠️ 注意：Thread2 的阻塞不影响 Thread1
      它们是不同的线程，独立执行
    end note
    
    Latch2 --> Future2: (阻塞等待)
    deactivate Latch2
    Future2 --> RpcClient: (阻塞)
    deactivate Future2
    RpcClient --> Thread2: (阻塞)
    deactivate RpcClient
end

== EventLoop 线程接收响应 ==

group 响应1到达
    EventLoopThread -> ClientHandler: channelRead(response1, opaque=1)
    activate ClientHandler
    
    ClientHandler -> Table: getFuture(opaque=1)
    activate Table
    note right of Table
      **从全局表获取同一个 ResponseFuture1 对象**
      这个对象是 Thread1 创建的
    end note
    Table --> ClientHandler: ResponseFuture1 (共享对象)
    deactivate Table
    
    ClientHandler -> Future1: putResponse(response1)
    activate Future1
    Future1 -> Future1: this.iRpcResponse = response1
    Future1 -> Latch1: countDown()
    activate Latch1
    note right of Latch1
      **EventLoop 线程唤醒业务线程1**
      CountDownLatch.countDown()
      唤醒所有等待这个 latch 的线程
      
      ⚠️ 关键：EventLoop 线程和业务线程1
      访问的是同一个 Latch1 对象
    end note
    
    Latch1 -> Thread1: 唤醒 Thread1
    note right of Thread1
      **业务线程1 被唤醒**
      从 WAITING 状态变为 RUNNABLE
      继续执行 waitResponse() 后续代码
    end note
    
    Latch1 --> Future1: 唤醒完成
    deactivate Latch1
    Future1 -> Table: remove(1)
    activate Table
    Table --> Future1: 移除成功
    deactivate Table
    Future1 --> ClientHandler: 响应已设置
    deactivate Future1
    
    ClientHandler --> EventLoopThread: 处理完成
    deactivate ClientHandler
end

group 响应2到达
    EventLoopThread -> ClientHandler: channelRead(response2, opaque=2)
    activate ClientHandler
    
    ClientHandler -> Table: getFuture(opaque=2)
    activate Table
    Table --> ClientHandler: ResponseFuture2 (共享对象)
    deactivate Table
    
    ClientHandler -> Future2: putResponse(response2)
    activate Future2
    Future2 -> Future2: this.iRpcResponse = response2
    Future2 -> Latch2: countDown()
    activate Latch2
    note right of Latch2
      **EventLoop 线程唤醒业务线程2**
      CountDownLatch.countDown()
      唤醒所有等待这个 latch 的线程
    end note
    
    Latch2 -> Thread2: 唤醒 Thread2
    note right of Thread2
      **业务线程2 被唤醒**
      从 WAITING 状态变为 RUNNABLE
      继续执行 waitResponse() 后续代码
    end note
    
    Latch2 --> Future2: 唤醒完成
    deactivate Latch2
    Future2 -> Table: remove(2)
    activate Table
    Table --> Future2: 移除成功
    deactivate Table
    Future2 --> ClientHandler: 响应已设置
    deactivate Future2
    
    ClientHandler --> EventLoopThread: 处理完成
    deactivate ClientHandler
end

== 业务线程获取结果 ==

Thread1 -> Future1: waitResponse() 返回
activate Future1
Future1 --> Thread1: IRpcResponse1
deactivate Future1

Thread2 -> Future2: waitResponse() 返回
activate Future2
Future2 --> Thread2: IRpcResponse2
deactivate Future2

== 问题2：阻塞会影响下一个请求吗？ ==

note over Thread1, Thread2
  **场景1：同一个线程顺序调用（会阻塞）**
  
  Thread1:
    请求1 → 阻塞等待响应1 (100ms)
    请求2 → 阻塞等待响应2 (100ms)  ← 必须等待请求1完成
  
  总耗时：200ms
  吞吐量：2 请求/200ms = 10 请求/秒
end note

note over Thread1, Thread2
  **场景2：不同线程并发调用（不会阻塞）**
  
  Thread1: 请求1 → 阻塞等待响应1 (100ms)
  Thread2: 请求2 → 阻塞等待响应2 (100ms)  ← 并发执行，互不影响
  
  总耗时：100ms（最慢的请求）
  吞吐量：2 请求/100ms = 20 请求/秒
end note

== CountDownLatch 对象共享机制 ==

note over Future1, Latch1
  **对象共享关系：**
  
  ResponseFuture1 {
    opaque = 1
    latch = CountDownLatch1  ←─── 共享对象
    iRpcResponse = null
  }
  
  ┌─────────────────┐
  │ CountDownLatch1 │  ←─── 多个线程可以访问
  └─────────────────┘
         │      │
    Thread1  EventLoopThread
    await()  countDown()
    (阻塞)   (唤醒)
end note

== 总结 ==

note over Thread1, Latch2
  **问题1：为什么可以跨线程唤醒？**
  
  ✅ 通过共享的 CountDownLatch 对象实现跨线程通信
  - ResponseFuture 存储在 FUTURE_TABLE 中，可以被多个线程访问
  - CountDownLatch 是线程安全的共享对象
  - 业务线程调用 await() 阻塞，EventLoop 线程调用 countDown() 唤醒
  - 底层使用操作系统的线程同步机制
  
  **问题2：阻塞会影响下一个请求吗？**
  
  ✅ 取决于调用场景
  - 同一个线程顺序调用：会阻塞，下一个请求必须等待
  - 不同线程并发调用：不会阻塞，每个请求独立执行
  - 线程池并发调用：不会阻塞，多个请求可以并发执行
end note

@enduml
